{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PtOisPzhGen6lciBJfJz8A","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:58.214131+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/PtOisPzhGen6lciBJfJz8A","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/qYjkV9srjbNceXWUHMPJlvZyNDpjeiaTS8DRgW4icjyEDmks5qQnYzGqicicdneAuA4ia2yibDXkLkd8aGnVzicgLLT3EkofmAOpe1pBnS4tFRfYeY/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/qYjkV9srjbPMJos4pv8c8AkicDy7ROLTcz2YicUBPmB8FlicW9n1iblicxia84EzCG3bW7kVWG4ycZ6B85oSCQuMBibN6wGKxURicUtKKSHjTM9icZdw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><span>上海外国语大学中国话语与世界文学研究中心本年度硕士研究生推免招生方向为“国别与区域研究”专业“中外文明交流互鉴”方向下设的“跨文化比较与文明互鉴”子方向，报考院系为上海全球治理与区域国别研究院。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>具体报名条件、申请材料、考核流程及时间安排，以《上海全球治理与区域国别研究院接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读硕士研究生招生简章》为准。</span></span></p><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU4MzMxNzkxMQ==&amp;mid=2247568449&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=e9c2d2f5319565e4edd21c8f651837d9&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>硕士推免 | 上海外国语大学区域国别学2027年接收优秀应届本科毕业生免试攻读研究生预报名招生简章</span></a></span></p></section></section></section><section></section></section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>1</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span> <span>招生方向简介</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>跨文化比较与文明互鉴：</span><span>立足多语种优势，以中华文化为根基，深化文明比较研究，分析不同文化间的交流模式及特征，探讨中国话语体系及其国际传播等问题，致力于消除跨文化交流壁垒，推进文明对话与文明互鉴。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>本研究中心培养方向主要聚焦于世界中国学（汉学）、中外文化交流互鉴、文化记忆研究、跨媒介研究等。</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>2</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>报考建议</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>欢迎具有理论与语言基础，具备外国文学、中国文学、文化研究、历史学、新闻传播学等相关学科背景，对中外文明互鉴、跨文化比较以及数智人文有学术兴趣的应届优秀本科生咨询报考。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>3</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>导师队伍</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/qYjkV9srjbNCOQAUwrIEtlvvxK7x7DrxS5SrIVcREMRlGwdLghPgOtUribIwz6qZbzYRN9LsXqvZVHSwFAgt9fspRKCM1H9ic9zBS3XYcQk1o/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>胡文婷</span></span></strong><span><span>，上海外国语大学中国话语与世界文学研究中心副教授，北京外国语大学比较文学与跨文化研究博士，曾访学罗马智慧大学东方学院、罗马慈幼会大学古典语言学系。现任比较文学学会海外汉学研究分会委员，兼《拉丁语言文化研究》学术顾问。</span></span><strong><span><span><span>主要从事世界中国学（汉学）、比较文学与跨文化研究、中西文化交流与互鉴史等研究</span></span></span></strong><span><span>，在CSSCI、A&amp;HCI等学术期刊发表论文30余篇，出版译著1部，丛书1部，主持国家社科基金冷门绝学、教育部人文社科基金等科研项目多项。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>huwenting21703@126.com</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/qYjkV9srjbMdqedOEIR6gVjy0dsjuORLggbggMbW8L3bE6q8leZYdnGu3ayEevN37iacF90SQVrbM1ziaDsiaMPnn2c1syhicZSia61um7uGtp1U/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section><section><span><br/></span></section></section><section><p><strong><span><br/></span></strong></p><p><strong><span><span>童欣</span></span></strong><span><span>，上海外国语大学中国话语与世界文学研究中心助理研究员，德国汉堡大学哲学博士，入选全国博士后人才激励计划。</span></span><span><strong><span><span>主要研究领域为记忆研究、媒介理论与移民研究</span></span></strong></span><span><span>，国际记忆研究协会、国际流亡研究协会成员。出版学术专著Transmedia Remembering: Eine Fallstudie des Shanghaier Exils in Deutschland und China seit 1990、《当代德国犹太流亡记忆与中国叙事》和学术译著《电视、记忆与怀旧》，在CSSCI、A&amp;HCI等学术期刊发表20篇文章，主持在研国家社科基金青年项目1项。</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><span>联系邮箱：</span><span>tongxin_flora@163.com</span></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>热烈欢迎优秀本科毕业生关注并加入我们！</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/qYjkV9srjbOOrtGA8ShZ5nuWeibAsW43iadsJuC53ibZNXXu1kRtsEibeoibGQJyQseClWMh3TldzDDGfnKfCFZhDu36BqicP2ynZQeJDAghB9Ow0/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/qYjkV9srjbMvy9dhcTdibs8fDNSEVScic1MeaIbCd8yASIbymJz9YxdQibibkWbfjyiaSPvBGpSk1AvsbVwNcRcnibLpFCXKI9o5YdI1bvmuwn1rs/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/qYjkV9srjbMg0qRsEhVHLYLhWQIAsibI1tpicn8nYv7BdaEJjMlXSsQbiadOt2O3kuMnaBU4I3vS1CpXrFXMunibiasKZd51nY3JjLOmyfcGGj4I/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><p><span><span>排版｜曲劢</span></span></p></section><section><span><br/></span></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"dc99dfec97e97f62b56eb4f0d66b0cc72924c8d1868b0555521491b92d6252a5","textLength":1009,"sourceSha256":"947da96239afa6e2e25c228ed414ea76de84da82c541b0621af83dce3b4ad547","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-a2a87f68c43dddf4148e","title":"2026年上海外国语大学中国话语与世界文学研究中心硕士推免｜2027级“跨文化比较与文明互鉴”方向推荐免试生招生","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:58.214131+00:00"}
